{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_glaze_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_glaze_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"聖城晚照","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_glaze_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"1c6a7ef1ba4c460ab8331771f0a13662440d508376c8e25c3ec7e3c55e7127fa","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"守城人安比爾看守著聖城的一面圍牆，卻屢屢遭遇嚮往自由的拉特蘭居民們對規則發起的挑戰。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g10_laterano_roof"},{"type":"narration","text":"喔……同學們，下課鈴響了。我們的課程時間永遠是這麼短暫。\n雖然個別同學早在鈴響前就溜走了，還有的一直趴在桌上睡大覺，但是這並無不妥。\n……“與銃械交流”本身就是一門將會伴隨你們終身的課程。\n同學們啊，你們都已經拿到了屬於自己的那一把守護銃。\n但你們想清楚將要用它守護什麼了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我睡著了？……好吵啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"上司打來的電話……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……還是掛掉吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安比爾！！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，隊長？我可是一直在堅守崗位喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"堅守崗位……？我跟你說過多少次了！戍衛隊就要有戍衛隊的樣子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"站好了！別躺在神聖的拉特蘭高牆上！你這麼喜歡躺著，怎麼不躺在聖徒像的懷裡？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"真的可以躺在聖徒像的懷裡嗎——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你……你少跟我嬉皮笑臉的！別忘了，我們守護的可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"拉——特——蘭——的——榮——耀——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼，希望你能把這句話放在心裡……今天是你的最後機會了，再搞砸，你就滾出戍衛隊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一座哨塔。\n這是守城人安比爾被分配看守的地方。一面寬大的圍牆分隔了辦公街區與休閒街區，這裡屢次出現翻牆事件。\n她的工作很簡單，只是阻止人們翻越圍牆；她的工作也很困難，畢竟沒人能遏制住拉特蘭人那顆嚮往自由的心。\n守城人叼著巧克力，觀察著這座藍色與白色相疊交錯的聖城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"鐘樓一切正常，學校一切正常，辦公區也一切正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"直到目前為止，都沒有什麼異常……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"守城人在終端上草草地寫上幾句工作紀錄，便再次躺在大理石露台上，慵懶地望向那片雲天。\n她不只一次產生過這樣的感覺。\n這座聖城，這座平靜、安寧，又一成不變的聖城——\n真像是天空落在這片大地上的倒影啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……下班後，要去哪裡逛逛呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心急的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好痛……是誰拿巧克力丟我？害我掉下來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡禁止通行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"你隨意翻越圍牆的行為，違反了街區管理法則，也擾亂了戍衛隊日常的防衛工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心急的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"順帶一提喔，我這只是例行公事，剛剛那句話也是複述我上司的原話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有任何異議，你可以去戍衛隊抗議，也可以向公證所呈文申訴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，要是你有正當理由，我也可以放你過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心急的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正當理由……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心急的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在確實要趕路……如果不從這裡翻牆走，我就要繞好大一圈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到那邊的側門了嗎？它應該能幫你省去不少路程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"你只要等一會，等到下班時間，從那個門走過去就行囉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"這個理由駁回了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心急的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等……下班時間？那可不行，我肯定會錯過的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"錯過什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心急的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不行，我不能說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"配合執行機密遺囑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心急的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"也對，你看起來也不像是執行者……那麼，協助運送重要物資？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心急的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"看來也不是信使……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心急的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但、但是……和這些差不多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心急的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正……我要去做的，是對我來說非常關鍵的事，而且今天是唯一的機會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼誇張嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心急的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，我確實不能再耽誤時間了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_365_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別、別追了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"敏捷的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_365_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，應該要往哪裡跑……這邊好了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爽朗的執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請你配合公證所的工作，不要再拒捕了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爽朗的執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦……？岔路？他跑到哪邊去了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"（指左邊）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爽朗的執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，好！多謝你，小姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心急的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那個，守城人小姐，請問可以放我走了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我有一個好主意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"narration","text":"一條小巷。\n太陽正向西落，樓宇影子遮住街巷的半邊，是個打瞌睡的好地方。\n守城人捂緊了耳朵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心急的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……守城人小姐，你想出來的辦法就是用炸藥把圍牆開個大洞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"規定不准翻牆，又沒規定不准把牆開個洞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心急的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"還呆站著幹嘛，你不急著走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心急的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好！多謝！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，這位執行者先生，接下來就要請你幫忙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爽朗的執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題，小事一樁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爽朗的執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……4月27日下午4點27分，位於帕尼拉大街與舒芙蕾大街交界處的一面圍牆完成合法爆破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爽朗的執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已在公證所執行者里凱萊的見證下執行完畢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"戍衛隊狙擊手，安比爾，已確保爆破行為未威脅公民的生命財產安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"搞定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝囉，執行者先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，剛才也多虧了你，我才能抓到這傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被銬住的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_365_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"我也沒做什麼，就是指個方向嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，別謙虛嘛，我知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那根立柱是你用銃擊倒的，對不對？如果沒有你，這傢伙也不會被攔住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼遠的距離……現在戍衛隊都要配備像你這麼厲害的狙擊手嗎？真是可怕啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，這算是在誇我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是你們這些空手就能解決問題的執行者才更可怕吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"在和平的拉特蘭，很難想像也會有你們不得不使用銃械的情形。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，要是不用銃械，怎樣才能在甜品店射擊比賽裡贏下甜甜圈大獎呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，守城人小姐，沒有別的事的話，我就先回去交差了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，有這個洞，我也省得繞遠路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？……等等，這條路好像通往那個地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊，沒想到我今天還真的能趕上，我本來以為絕對沒機會了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被銬住的拉特蘭人","speakerId":"avg_npc_365_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇——好痛！請慢點！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼地方啊，那麼神祕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安比爾！！！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"又有什麼事啊，隊長？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我以為在我打來之前，你已經想好怎麼解釋牆上的大洞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人違反規定喔，我真的有好好堅守崗位的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……少跟我耍花招！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"從現在開始，你的工作多了一項——看好那個洞，不准讓任何人通過！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"narration","text":"一座斜陽裡的城市。\n將兩個雪糕筒路障擺放在圍牆上的洞前，守城人忽然感受到一道目光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"好無聊啊，隊長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"你就算要監督我，也沒必要藏起來吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那道身影躲在樹後，小心地探出了頭，卻正好對上守城人的目光，馬上又把臉藏了起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……是個孩子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羞怯的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……別、別過來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得，現在應該還沒到放學時間吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"勸你乖乖回到教室，我會當作沒看到的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羞怯的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也……也先別走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羞怯的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請待在原地就好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羞怯的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我……我只是想看看你的銃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"我的銃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……看你的樣子，好像是快要到選擇守護銃的年紀了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"來，這下子能看得更清楚了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羞怯的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"怎樣，讓你失望了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羞怯的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為、為什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羞怯的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼……你的守護銃和聖徒像的守護銃長得那麼像？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"這個嘛……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g8_laterano_dwelling"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銃械工坊工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，還沒選好你的守護銃嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銃械工坊工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"工坊裡的存貨都給你看過了，如果你全都不喜歡，或許……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的安比爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銃械工坊工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銃械工坊工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……你是指聖徒像拿著的那把長銃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銃械工坊工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但那是雕塑上的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的安比爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銃械工坊工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銃械工坊工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那把銃是過去的經典款式，我應該還能找到拆解圖。現做一把得花點時間，過幾天你來拿就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的安比爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多謝你，工匠先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銃械工坊工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這不算什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銃械工坊工匠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"倒是像你一樣以聖徒為榜樣的孩子，現在已經很少見囉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"我選擇它做守護銃……沒什麼特別的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"它很輕，射程也足夠遠，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羞怯的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"射程足夠遠？但我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係。使用它，不需要特別高超的射擊天賦，也不需要什麼偉大的志向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"它就是一把銃，你當然也可以選擇一模一樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羞怯的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羞怯的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……對不起，你可能誤會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羞怯的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"書上說聖徒的子彈就是律法降下的懲罰，被打中的話特別特別痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羞怯的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想確認一下，要是我偷偷穿過這個洞，這把聖徒的銃，應該不會向我開火吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"narration","text":"目送翹課的孩子返回學校之後，守城人行過街角。\n晚鐘還未敲響，街上只有零星的幾個行人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"兩個巧克力冰淇淋球，再加點可可碎片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_367_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……今天這裡好冷清啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_367_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……可能是因為帕尼拉大街那邊的甜品店正在舉行限時活動吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"限時活動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_367_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，據說在賣特別限定版巧克力黃昏慕斯，只有今天一天，而且活動到五點半就截止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"特別限定版巧克力黃昏慕斯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"五點半就結束……好多人還沒有下班、沒有放學呢，不是都趕不上了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_367_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_367_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些人啊，就算是請假也一定要去買，我這裡可競爭不過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"怪不得……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_367_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，拿好您的冰淇淋，謝謝惠顧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"守城人一轉頭，忽然看見一旁的下水井蓋正在詭異地跳動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，喂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有人在嗎？誰能來幫幫我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"來，抓住它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窘迫的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲，總算得救了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窘迫的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？把我從下水道裡拉上來的這把長銃……我好像在哪裡見過……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……老師？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窘迫的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……原來是安比爾，好久不見啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真好，看起來你已經成長為一名出色的守城人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼會在下水道裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，我是在和我的守護銃交流啊，就像我以前教你的那樣，不記得了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……是說在禁閉室的那次嗎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外面的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我爸爸做了超甜奶油蛋糕！誰想吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外面的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有還有，這是我家店裡做的蜂蜜瘤奶昔，誰要喝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外面的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂！你做什麼？快把我的巧克力還給我！還給我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被關禁閉的學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被關禁閉的學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我被關了多久了？好餓……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被關禁閉的學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要踩在椅子上，我就能從高窗翻出去……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"學校老師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很好，看來你的確有學到什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被關禁閉的學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……老師？我不是想要……我下次不會再……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"學校老師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。禁閉室能關住你的人，但是並不能關住你的心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"學校老師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你用銃打碎了高窗的玻璃，這就是你和銃械交流的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被關禁閉的學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我明知道這違反了學校的規定，但我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"學校老師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……沒關係的，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"學校老師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"銃械之所以重要，就是因為它能讓你正視自己的內心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"學校老師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭也因此才能變得越來越好，成為守護人們心之所向的樂園。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被關禁閉的學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"心之所向……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"學校老師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，安比爾，你現在最想要什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被關禁閉的學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我……我想要……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被關禁閉的學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想要……巧克力……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，對，沒錯！你該不會是還在記恨我關你禁閉吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，看到你手上的巧克力冰淇淋，我就知道你並沒有遺忘我的教誨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……被你這麼說，我有點不想吃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，老師又是因為什麼樣的心之所向，才鑽進了下水道裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"不去管學生們，偷偷跑出來，真的沒問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你看，這是我的守護銃。剛剛我握著它在學校的禱告廳祈禱，忽然感受到一股強烈的呼喚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"順著它的指引，我發現禱告廳地下竟有一個神祕通道。走到盡頭，我就看到頭頂有光亮……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來以為我將見證奇蹟，結果……你也看到了，我卡在了這個下水道口動彈不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"說得那麼玄之又玄的，老師其實就是想翹班吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我想我的守護銃想要的更簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它一定只是想看看，拉特蘭今天的夕陽吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"順便……要是能趕上今天的甜品店限時活動就更好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……果然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"這個理由可不足以讓你逃脫罰責喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"涉嫌破壞下水管線，擾亂正常通行秩序，以及在非開放時間翻越圍牆，雖然是從地下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦安比爾，之後我會主動去公證所領罰的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但要是錯過了限定版甜品，還錯過了聖城一天中最輝煌的時分，那就太可惜了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"就在此時，戍衛隊的新兵們在街對面列隊行過。\n金色的夕照落在他們的銃上，落在他們的帽檐上，落在他們稚嫩卻莊嚴的面容上。\n就像流淌在瘤奶吐司上的楓糖漿，也像傾倒在格子鬆餅上的蜂蜜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"夕陽……是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"夕陽總會平等地灑在聖城的每個角落，這堵圍牆可攔不住它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"守城人舉起長銃，瞄準遠方鐘樓的頂端，深呼吸——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g15_eveningglow_L2"},{"type":"narration","text":"街上的行人抬起頭來，樓宇裡的居民望向窗外，街區中的所有拉特蘭人幾乎在同一時刻屏息——\n鐘聲鳴響，幾隻羽獸披著霞光，徐徐飛過晴空。\n短暫的沉默後，歡聲笑語帶著人們的心之所向，從街區的各個角落紛至沓來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"45分19秒。比預定的鐘聲響起時間早了45分19秒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"本街區的下班時間也將提早45分19秒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們可以早點走出房間，與朋友們交談去哪裡度過愉快的夜晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"更重要的是，大家都不會錯過如此美好的夕陽，不是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安比爾，你是為了讓大家都趕上甜品店的限時活動吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈哈，還有十多分鐘，我反正肯定能趕上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"老師，我可以和你一起去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不接？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"不接，我下班了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1252_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……還真是亂來啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的拉特蘭人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，今天的鐘聲是不是響得太早了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"過路的拉特蘭人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇！夕陽真好看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的拉特蘭人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我有一個提議，以後每年的這一天，我們都早一個小時下班吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"過路的拉特蘭人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我同意！"},{"type":"narration","text":"守城人看見霞雲後的落日露出頭來，聖城在天空中的倒影也向她眨了眨眼。\n不覺間，街上已經人來人往。在拉特蘭平凡的一天中，到處洋溢著自由與歡笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"這才是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安比爾","speakerId":"char_302_glaze","isRemote":false,"text":"……拉特蘭的榮耀啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_302_glaze","aliases":["安比爾"]}]}
